  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Brand</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Welcome to Superbloom Labs, where we believe in enjoying life to the fullest while embracing a natural approach to wellness. Our flagship product, the Recovery Liver Support,&nbsp;is designed to support your liver and enhance your wellbeing post drinking. We understand that life is about celebrating moments, and with our 100% natural blend of high-performance superherbs, amino acids, and vitamins, you can wake up feeling refreshed and ready to seize the day.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">At Superbloom Labs, we prioritize quality and transparency. Our products are non-GMO, vegan, gluten-free, and made in the USA, ensuring that you receive the best nature has to offer. Each batch is third-party tested to guarantee safety and efficacy.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Whether you're out with friends or celebrating a special occasion, our convenient sachets are your perfect drinking buddy. Simply take one before or during drinking, and for optimal results, another before bed. It&rsquo;s that easy to enjoy the night and own the morning!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Join our community of happy customers and discover the difference that natural support can make. Explore our offerings, sign up for exclusive updates, and embark on a journey to a healthier, more vibrant you with Superbloom Labs. Cheers to celebrating responsibly!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Product description</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>100% Natural Ingredients</strong>: Carefully selected herbs to support your body.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Non-GMO, Vegan, and Gluten-Free</strong>: Suitable for various dietary preferences.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Made in the USA</strong>: Proudly produced with quality and integrity.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>3rd Party Tested</strong>: Ensuring safety and effectiveness for peace of mind.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>How to Use:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Before or During Drinking</strong>: Take 1 sachet (2 capsules) to prepare your body.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>For Best Results</strong>: After a big night, take another sachet before bed.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Wake Up Ready</strong>: Feel revitalized and ready to enjoy the day ahead!</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Convenient &amp; Portable: Perfectly packaged for on-the-go lifestyles, making it easy to share with friends or take on your next adventure.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Payment terms</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-si